Ms-from-scratch/blob/main/pkg/llms_from_scratch/llama3.py">here</a><span>.)=
</span></p><p><span>While GQA is mainly a computational-efficiency workarou=
nd for MHA, ablation studies (such as those in the</span><a href=3D"https:/=
/arxiv.org/abs/2305.13245"> original GQA paper</a><span> and the </span><a =
href=3D"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.09288">Llama 2 paper</a><span>) show it =
performs comparably to standard MHA in terms of LLM modeling performance.</=
